# Verification: prd/01-hellscape.md (turn 15)

Reviewed against the raw deliverable `runs/turn8-20/deliverables/turn15.md`
(350 lines; fence ````markdown:prd/01-hellscape.md` + `<!-- TURN_END:15 -->`),
the tree file `tree/prd/01-hellscape.md` (byte-identical to the raw inner
content — verified by direct diff), the developer prompt
(`runs/turn8-20/extract/developer_prompt.md`), the five prior accepted files
in this turn's dependency set (kernel, lifecycle, and external-connector
